WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

1
00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:02.590
Before we say goodbye, we love to play a quick round

2
00:00:02.590 --> 00:00:05.853
of "Drewth or Dare".
(audience cheers)

3
00:00:08.275 --> 00:00:09.930
And since we're celebrating "Scream" today,

4
00:00:09.930 --> 00:00:12.610 line:15%
we actually have two huge "Scream" fans here.

5
00:00:12.610 --> 00:00:15.376 line:15%
It's Jenna and Destiny.

6
00:00:15.376 --> 00:00:18.570 line:15%
Hi.
(audience cheers)

7
00:00:18.570 --> 00:00:20.220 line:15%
Now, in "Drewth or Dare",

8
00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:22.650 line:15%
usually, I'll say or do anything.

9
00:00:22.650 --> 00:00:24.280
Anything.
Because I'm game.

10
00:00:24.280 --> 00:00:25.113
Uh-hmm.

11
00:00:25.113 --> 00:00:29.753
But, actually, I'm gonna hand this one over to you today.

12
00:00:30.640 --> 00:00:32.333
Take it away.
Thank you.

13
00:00:33.750 --> 00:00:36.940
I wrote a little something, 'cause I write a lot.

14
00:00:36.940 --> 00:00:37.773
I write a lot of poetry,

15
00:00:37.773 --> 00:00:40.065
but I knew today, I needed a little help.

16
00:00:40.065 --> 00:00:42.530
(paper rustling)
(clears throat)

17
00:00:42.530 --> 00:00:45.700
Destiny.
Oh, God. (laughs nervously)

18
00:00:45.700 --> 00:00:48.820
Our story is one of growth, communication,

19
00:00:48.820 --> 00:00:51.700
unwavering support, and love.

20
00:00:51.700 --> 00:00:54.570
We might not have started because of "Scream",

21
00:00:54.570 --> 00:00:57.760
but our journey and our love has flourished

22
00:00:57.760 --> 00:01:00.910
through all the adventures and the amazing people

23
00:01:00.910 --> 00:01:03.310
that we've met along the way.

24
00:01:03.310 --> 00:01:06.600
We are here because of all of those people and you

25
00:01:08.010 --> 00:01:10.880
and just everybody that lifted us up.

26
00:01:10.880 --> 00:01:12.640
Now, I know you were bummed

27
00:01:12.640 --> 00:01:15.170
because you didn't have a family heirloom

28
00:01:15.170 --> 00:01:17.970
to pass down between you and your brothers from your grandma

29
00:01:17.970 --> 00:01:21.010
when she passed, but your mom had that taken care of

30
00:01:21.010 --> 00:01:22.113
behind the scenes.

31
00:01:23.650 --> 00:01:26.400
It is an honor to have this opportunity

32
00:01:26.400 --> 00:01:29.000
and an even bigger one to ask you this

33
00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:30.060
with the ring that belonged

34
00:01:30.060 --> 00:01:31.960
to your favorite person, your grandma.

35
00:01:33.930 --> 00:01:37.143
I am so lucky and we are so lucky.

36
00:01:38.960 --> 00:01:40.293
So Destiny Justine,

37
00:01:41.310 --> 00:01:42.143
oh, God.

38
00:01:45.100 --> 00:01:46.701
Will you marry me?

39
00:01:46.701 --> 00:01:50.010
Of course, yes.
(audience cheers)

40
00:01:50.010 --> 00:01:53.343
Oh, boy (indistinct).

41
00:02:01.856 --> 00:02:03.371
(indistinct talking)

42
00:02:03.371 --> 00:02:07.288
(audience cheers continuously)

43
00:02:16.196 --> 00:02:18.038
Oh, I'm so happy for you.

44
00:02:18.038 --> 00:02:19.801
Thank you so much.

45
00:02:19.801 --> 00:02:22.056
Oh.
Should we ask our question?

46
00:02:22.056 --> 00:02:24.167
I am so happy for you both.

47
00:02:24.167 --> 00:02:26.567
How do you feel?
I'm so happy (indistinct).

48
00:02:28.351 --> 00:02:30.940
(audience cheers)

49
00:02:30.940 --> 00:02:33.209
(indistinct talking)

50
00:02:33.209 --> 00:02:35.950
Oh, I love that, I'm so happy for you.

51
00:02:35.950 --> 00:02:37.940
And you know what's so beautiful?

52
00:02:37.940 --> 00:02:40.960
Is that you choose each other, you know?

53
00:02:40.960 --> 00:02:45.960
And that's the hope for all of us, you know?

54
00:02:46.130 --> 00:02:47.920
That we might get to choose somebody

55
00:02:47.920 --> 00:02:51.570
or that somebody chooses us to choose to love,

56
00:02:51.570 --> 00:02:53.010
to be brave enough to love,

57
00:02:53.010 --> 00:02:54.650
to show that love.

58
00:02:54.650 --> 00:02:57.100
Thank you for doing it here with us today.

59
00:02:57.100 --> 00:02:58.410
It's such an honor.

60
00:02:58.410 --> 00:03:00.724
No, it's an honor.
Thank you.

61
00:03:00.724 --> 00:03:02.753
(audience applauds)

62
00:03:02.753 --> 00:03:04.680
I love love, I can't help it.

63
00:03:04.680 --> 00:03:06.322
It's so great.

64
00:03:06.322 --> 00:03:08.651
(audience cheers and applauds)

65
00:03:08.651 --> 00:03:10.696
Thank you so much.

66
00:03:10.696 --> 00:03:13.848
Thank you for choosing to spend your time with us.

67
00:03:13.848 --> 00:03:17.681 line:15%
We make this show for you so take it with you.

68
00:03:18.935 --> 00:03:22.102 line:15%
(upbeat outro music)

